== Introduction ==

Reference for FreeCAD '''default keyboard shortcuts''': how multi-key shortcuts work, where to view and change them, and stock defaults by category (same categories as the '''Keyboard''' tab in Customize).

Covers '''stock FreeCAD {{Version|1.1}}''' (including 1.1.1): core commands and built-in workbenches. Does not cover user macros or third-party addons (SheetMetal, Cables, Assembly3, EM, and similar).

Shortcuts only run for '''active''' commands (standard menu, active workbench, or a visible toolbar). If you customized keys, or a workbench is not loaded, what you see in the UI wins. Check with {{MenuCommand|Tools &rarr; Customize... &rarr; Keyboard}}.

See also [[Interface_Customization|Interface Customization]] and [[Std_DlgCustomize|Std DlgCustomize]].

