== Notes ==

* Stock FreeCAD {{Version|1.1}} defaults only: no user macros, no third-party addons.
* If your install differs, use {{MenuCommand|Tools &rarr; Customize... &rarr; Keyboard}}.
* Draft and similar tools also have '''in-command''' keys in the task panel while a tool runs. Those are not the same as global accelerators; see the command page and [[Draft_Preferences|Draft Preferences]].
* Mouse navigation bindings are separate: [[Mouse_navigation|Mouse navigation]].
* PartDesign often has no defaults; assign shortcuts if you want them.

